#: ../../source/index.rst:5 8d57aadb70844bdd9166dbfb338784c8
msgid "Welcome to the ArduPilot Development Site"
msgstr "欢迎访问 ArduPilot 开发站点"

#: ../../source/index.rst:9 6905011057d04027a196fe942198e9c3
msgid ""
"Keep up with the latest ArduPilot related blogs on `ArduPilot.org! "
"<https://ardupilot.org/>`__"
msgstr "在 `ArduPilot.org! <https://ardupilot.org/>`__ 上了解最新 ArduPilot 相关博客"

#: ../../source/index.rst:11 48fd0ab807894afd92f128f643a6f7d8
msgid ""
":ref:`ArduPilot <ardupilot:home>` is the leading open source autopilot "
"system supporting multi-copters, traditional helicopters, fixed wing "
"aircraft, rovers, submarines and antenna trackers."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ArduPilot <ardupilot:home>` "
"是领先的开源飞控系统，支持多旋翼、传统直升机、固定翼飞机、地面车辆、潜水器和天线追踪器。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:14 fb5c445314094aa7b77cbd01d2ca1c73
msgid ""
"We pride ourselves on being **versatile** (rich in features with support for"
" a large number of flight controllers, sensors and frame types), **trusted**"
" (reliable and predictable) and **open** (both in terms of software and in "
"our team's organisation and governance)."
msgstr ""
"我们以 **多功能** （功能丰富，支持大量飞控、传感器和机架类型）、**可靠** （稳定可预期）和 **开放** "
"（无论是软件还是团队组织与治理）为荣。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:16 416cad7aba0e42259dc1c6af6e38b918
msgid ""
"The source code is developed by a group of volunteer and professional (i.e. "
"paid) developers who, along with our users and `Partners "
"<https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__, make up the `ArduPilot Community "
"<https://ardupilot.org>`__."
msgstr ""
"源代码由一群志愿者和专业开发者（即受薪开发者）开发，他们与我们的用户和 `合作伙伴 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ 共同构成了 `ArduPilot 社区 "
"<https://ardupilot.org>`__。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:19 15dee28562164748b574aedfc1941238
msgid "Getting Involved"
msgstr "参与贡献"

#: ../../source/index.rst:21 f517ff9b33af4c9982ceac2239866441
msgid "New developers are always welcome! The best way to start is to:"
msgstr "始终欢迎新开发者加入！最好的入门方式是："

#: ../../source/index.rst:23 4bd3fd412adc4f9f881ce1527400046a
msgid ""
"read this wiki to learn the basics of the software and :ref:`how the team "
"works <how-the-team-works>`"
msgstr "阅读本 wiki，了解软件基础知识和 :ref:`团队工作方式 <how-the-team-works>`"

#: ../../source/index.rst:24 c892a5f9f7034dde8588a772fee35f1d
msgid ""
"get involved with the other developers by posting on the `Developer Team "
"Forum <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/development-team>`__, chat to us on "
"`ArduPilot Discord Chat <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ or join the "
":ref:`weekly development call <ardupilot-discord-server>`.  You can also "
"find a large number of users and some developers in the `ArduPilot facebook "
"group <https://www.facebook.com/groups/ArduPilot.org>`__.  :ref:`All "
"channels <common-contact-us>` are open to all.  Lurk for a while to get a "
"feel for it, then participate!"
msgstr ""
"通过在 `开发者团队论坛 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/development-team>`__ 发帖、在 "
"`ArduPilot Discord 聊天 <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ 与我们交流，或参加 "
":ref:`每周开发例会 <ardupilot-discord-server>` 与其他开发者互动。您也可以在 `ArduPilot Facebook "
"群组 <https://www.facebook.com/groups/ArduPilot.org>`__ "
"中找到大量用户和部分开发者。:ref:`所有频道 <common-contact-us>` 均对所有人开放。先潜水一段时间感受一下，然后积极参与！"

#: ../../source/index.rst:25 5db2189d269c40be8966dcaced15e654
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"find a specific bug you'd like to fix or a feature you'd like to add (check "
"out the `good first issues "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22good+first+issue%22>`__,"
" recent `issues from Randy "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/created_by/rmackay9>`__ or "
"our :ref:`roadmap <roadmap>` for ideas)."
msgstr ""
"找到您想修复的特定 bug 或您想添加的功能（可参考 `适合新手的 issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22good+first+issue%22>`__、Randy"
" 最近提交的 `issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/created_by/rmackay9>`__ 或我们的 "
":ref:`路线图 <roadmap>` 以获取灵感）。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:26 3793ee94dd414d9fb4674519436939e0
msgid ""
"fix the bug in your own clone and :ref:`test <simulation-2>` that it's "
"working"
msgstr "在您自己的克隆中修复 bug 并 :ref:`测试 <simulation-2>` 其是否正常工作"

#: ../../source/index.rst:27 a5bb253a752a45889a4ae20a4bc37a5f
msgid ""
"submit the change to the main code base :ref:`via a pull request "
"<submitting-patches-back-to-master>`."
msgstr ":ref:`通过 PR <submitting-patches-back-to-master>` 将更改提交到主代码库。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:30 a98bb0f9e7b24b26a7eaef4152a1478c
msgid "Why the name?"
msgstr "为何叫这个名字？"

#: ../../source/index.rst:32 4306b92e33264e4ea8f0e34c4dbe1b19
msgid ""
"The 'Ardu' part of the ArduPilot name comes from `Arduino "
"<http://www.arduino.cc/>`__. The original :ref:`APM1 and APM2 <common-"
"apm25-and-26-overview>` boards were based around the Arduino development "
"environment and AVR CPUs. We long ago outgrew these boards so we recommend "
"users use one of the many more capable boards found on our :ref:`Autopilot "
"Hardware Options page <common-autopilots>` including the Pixhawk."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 名称中的「Ardu」来源于 `Arduino <http://www.arduino.cc/>`__。最初的 :ref:`APM1 "
"和 APM2 <common-apm25-and-26-overview>` 板基于 Arduino 开发环境和 AVR "
"CPU。我们很早就已超越这些板的能力，因此建议用户使用我们 :ref:`飞控硬件选项页面 <common-autopilots>` "
"上列出的众多更强大的板，包括 Pixhawk。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:35 caa5e4981b2c44cd98210d457448b205
msgid ""
"A timeline history of ArduPilot can be found :ref:`here <history-of-"
"ardupilot>`."
msgstr "ArduPilot 的历史时间线可在 :ref:`此处 <history-of-ardupilot>` 找到。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:38 792ecd5bad284adcb6b51cf9ade25b03
msgid "Supported boards"
msgstr "支持的板型"

#: ../../source/index.rst:40 ad44373cb43e4eb3a26059f09c3d3231
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Autopilot Hardware Options <common-autopilots>` page provides an "
"overview for all the supported controller boards, including :ref:`Pixhawk "
"<common-pixhawk-overview>`, :ref:`The Cube <common-thecube-overview>`, "
":ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>`, :ref:`NAVIO2 <common-"
"navio2-overview>`, :ref:`Bebop2 <copter:parrot-bebop-autopilot>`, etc."
msgstr ""
":ref:`飞控硬件选项 <common-autopilots>` 页面提供了所有受支持控制器板的概览，包括 :ref:`Pixhawk "
"<common-pixhawk-overview>`、:ref:`The Cube <common-thecube-"
"overview>`、:ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>`、:ref:`NAVIO2 <common-"
"navio2-overview>`、:ref:`Bebop2 <copter:parrot-bebop-autopilot>` 等。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:44 e31fadad4a774c0088b844df193eb024
msgid ""
"To get going quickly please consider purchasing one of the :ref:`ready-to-"
"fly vehicles <common-rtf>` including the very low-cost `SkyRocket/SkyViper "
"drone <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/skyrocket.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"为了快速上手，请考虑购买 :ref:`即飞飞行器 <common-rtf>` 之一，包括非常低价的 `SkyRocket/SkyViper 无人机 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/skyrocket.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:46 8e9bf1556b154cd7a2470ee209ecf14f
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot source code includes the `AP-HAL "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL>`__ "
"Hardware Abstraction Layer, making it relatively easy to port the code to a "
"wide range of autopilot boards."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 源代码包含 `AP-HAL "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL>`__ "
"硬件抽象层，使得将代码移植到各种飞控板上相对容易。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:51 91b0217dac1b42d59f22152b7a5eab5d
msgid "Project List"
msgstr "项目列表"

#: ../../source/index.rst:53 a15d81f022b243d3ae9b261dc37ec15b
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot system is made up of (or relies upon) several different "
"projects which are listed below.  Those marked with an asterix (\\*) are "
"peer projects that have their own owners outside the core ArduPilot dev "
"team."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 系统由以下几个不同项目组成（或依赖）。标有星号（\\*）的项目是由 ArduPilot 核心开发团队外部人员负责的同级项目。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:58 6f848882aee24a11966c6ff68657834e
msgid ""
"Plane (:ref:`wiki <plane:home>`, `code "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__) - autopilot for planes"
msgstr ""
"Plane（:ref:`wiki <plane:home>`、`代码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__）——固定翼飞机飞控"

#: ../../source/index.rst:61 edc98fdc4c6446dfa95e8c444d1ddaa9
msgid ""
"Copter (:ref:`wiki <copter:home>`, `code "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__) - autopilot for multicopters "
"and traditional helicopters"
msgstr ""
"Copter（:ref:`wiki <copter:home>`、`代码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__）——多旋翼和传统直升机飞控"

#: ../../source/index.rst:64 987d4f4e76b8461d91e53eb39f2161b2
msgid ""
"Rover (:ref:`wiki <rover:home>`, `code "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__) - autopilot for ground vehicles"
msgstr ""
"Rover（:ref:`wiki <rover:home>`、`代码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__）——地面车辆飞控"

#: ../../source/index.rst:67 844e8a944adc42c3b48ed063fbed26ee
msgid ""
"Sub (:ref:`wiki <sub:home>`, `code "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__) - autopilot for submersible "
"vehicles"
msgstr ""
"Sub（:ref:`wiki <sub:home>`、`代码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__）——潜水器飞控"

#: ../../source/index.rst:70 0766059ee2224631b2e4f88785bda59f
msgid ""
"Antenna Tracker (:ref:`wiki <antennatracker:home>`, `code "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__) - for automatically aiming an "
"antenna at a vehicle"
msgstr ""
"Antenna Tracker（:ref:`wiki <antennatracker:home>`、`代码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__）——用于自动将天线对准飞行器"

#: ../../source/index.rst:72 b7ece2d091aa47bf9fe43cdf8e2a2307
msgid ""
"Mission Planner (:ref:`wiki <planner:home>`, `code "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner>`__) - the most commonly used "
"ground station written in C# for windows but also runs on Linux and MacOS "
"via mono"
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner（:ref:`wiki <planner:home>`、`代码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner>`__）——最常用的地面站，用 C# 为 Windows "
"编写，也可通过 Mono 在 Linux 和 MacOS 上运行"

#: ../../source/index.rst:76 a0937a9dc6974cda875a9ed7e994ef49
msgid ""
"APM Planner 2.0 (:ref:`wiki <planner2:home>`, `code "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/apm_planner>`__) is a ground station "
"specifically for APM written in C++ using the Qt libraries"
msgstr ""
"APM Planner 2.0（:ref:`wiki <planner2:home>`、`代码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/apm_planner>`__）是专为 APM 设计的地面站，使用 Qt 库以 C++ 编写"

#: ../../source/index.rst:79 8a6fea3d1c524acfbd01aa9561523eb8
msgid ""
":ref:`MAVProxy <mavproxy:home>` - command line oriented and scriptable "
"ground station (mostly used by developers)"
msgstr ":ref:`MAVProxy <mavproxy:home>` ——面向命令行且可脚本化的地面站（主要供开发者使用）"

#: ../../source/index.rst:81 91ff4acc37be48de8647fd95bf1d08f4
msgid ""
"`DroneKit <http://dronekit.io/>`__ - APM SDK for apps running on vehicles, "
"mobile devices and/or in the cloud."
msgstr "`DroneKit <http://dronekit.io/>`__ ——用于在飞行器、移动设备和/或云端运行应用的 APM SDK。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:82 41e09f9c6a5c4c77a56711ed7cd8ecad
msgid ""
"MinimOSD (`wiki <http://code.google.com/p/arducam-osd/wiki/minimosd>`__, "
"`code <https://github.com/diydrones/MinimOSD-Extra>`__) - on-screen display "
"of flight data"
msgstr ""
"MinimOSD（`wiki <http://code.google.com/p/arducam-osd/wiki/minimosd>`__、`代码 "
"<https://github.com/diydrones/MinimOSD-Extra>`__）——飞行数据的屏幕显示"

#: ../../source/index.rst:85 afc245fdfc7543ea9d7967b4d88c6d5f
msgid ""
"Tower (`wiki <https://github.com/DroidPlanner/Tower/wiki>`__, `code "
"<https://github.com/DroidPlanner/Tower>`__, `google play "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.droidplanner.android>`__)"
" - android ground station"
msgstr ""
"Tower（`wiki <https://github.com/DroidPlanner/Tower/wiki>`__、`代码 "
"<https://github.com/DroidPlanner/Tower>`__、`Google Play "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.droidplanner.android>`__）——Android"
" 地面站"

#: ../../source/index.rst:88 fdc6179373d04bc9beec7216481c7c14
msgid ""
"`QGroundControl* <http://www.qgroundcontrol.org/>`__ is an alternative "
"ground station written in C++ using the Qt libraries"
msgstr ""
"`QGroundControl* <http://www.qgroundcontrol.org/>`__ 是使用 Qt 库以 C++ 编写的替代地面站"

#: ../../source/index.rst:89 6b94b8a2b47e4fb19288cf89edc17ef4
msgid ""
"`PX4* <https://pixhawk.org/start>`__ - designers of the original PX4FMU "
"hardware (from which the Pixhawk was developed)"
msgstr ""
"`PX4* <https://pixhawk.org/start>`__ ——原始 PX4FMU 硬件的设计者（Pixhawk 由此发展而来）"

#: ../../source/index.rst:90 7e0048f7844e4bf0892c6f2f366d3bec
msgid ""
"`MAVLink* <https://mavlink.io>`__ - the protocol for communication between "
"the ground station, flight controller and some peripherals including the "
"OSD. A \"Dummy's Guide\" to working with MAVLink is `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/group/arducopterusergroup/forum/mavlink-tutorial-for-"
"absolute-dummies-part-i>`__."
msgstr ""
"`MAVLink* <https://mavlink.io>`__ ——用于地面站、飞控和部分外设（包括 OSD）之间通信的协议。MAVLink "
"使用的「傻瓜指南」在 `这里 "
"<https://diydrones.com/group/arducopterusergroup/forum/mavlink-tutorial-for-"
"absolute-dummies-part-i>`__。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:95 d5bc081402ff42149129bdf721033b3d
msgid ""
"`UAVCAN* <http://uavcan.org>`__ - Lightweight protocol designed for reliable"
" communication in aerospace and robotic applications via CAN bus. ArduPilot "
"is using the `Libuavcan <http://uavcan.org/Implementations/Libuavcan/>`__, "
"which is a portable, cross-platform library written in C++ with minimal "
"dependency on the C++ standard library and calls its version DroneCAN, "
"allowing UAVCAN to evolve separately."
msgstr ""
"`UAVCAN* <http://uavcan.org>`__ ——专为通过 CAN "
"总线在航空航天和机器人应用中实现可靠通信而设计的轻量级协议。ArduPilot 使用 `Libuavcan "
"<http://uavcan.org/Implementations/Libuavcan/>`__，这是一个用 C++ 编写的可移植跨平台库，对 C++"
" 标准库的依赖极少，并将其版本称为 DroneCAN，使 UAVCAN 可以独立演进。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:101 761f7309c5c2492d8ba35d984f4fcb13
msgid "How the team works"
msgstr "团队工作方式"

#: ../../source/index.rst:103 132c2a534b6744d09c9048c088e38a00
msgid ""
"Our annual developers conference is held in Feb/March in Canberra Australia "
"(`2018 announcement <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/developer-meetup-in-"
"canberra-february-2018>`__)."
msgstr ""
"我们的年度开发者大会在二三月间于澳大利亚堪培拉举行（`2018 年公告 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/developer-meetup-in-canberra-"
"february-2018>`__）。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:104 8c76b4cdd4c348159ea741b8e569f2d8
msgid ""
"The source code for ArduPilot is managed using git on "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot"
msgstr "ArduPilot 的源代码通过 git 在 https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot 上管理"

#: ../../source/index.rst:105 943b0152eced4a40afccb63d978a0c77
msgid ""
"Pre-compiled firmware for supported autopilot boards is available from "
"https://firmware.ardupilot.org"
msgstr "支持的飞控板的预编译固件可从 https://firmware.ardupilot.org 获取"

#: ../../source/index.rst:106 d0cd96dbae50446ba742acb465f78054
msgid ""
"User support is available on the `forums "
